## 4. Special Callouts & References

### Alert Callouts
Use these standardized blockquotes to create colored informational callouts:

> [!NOTE]
> Useful information users should know.

> [!TIP]
> Helpful advice for doing things better.

> [!IMPORTANT]
> Crucial information necessary to avoid failure.

> [!WARNING]
> Critical content demanding immediate user attention.

> [!CAUTION]
> Negative consequences of an action.

### Footnotes
Here is a text sentence needing a reference marker.[^1]

[^1]: This is the citation text that will dynamically render at the bottom of the page.

