## 6. Allowed Interactive HTML Tags

### Expandable Details Dropdown
<details>
<summary>Click here to expand and read more!</summary>

This text stays neatly hidden until a user clicks the arrow to toggle it open.

</details>

### Subscript, Superscript, and Underline
* Text with <sub>subscript</sub> values.
* Text with <sup>superscript</sup> values.
* Text with <u>underlines</u>.
